license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable contract that tells any AI agent, chat or model which commands prove a change to a
  file, enforced by a commit hook, CI and a verification runner that reports PASS, FAIL or NOT RUN.
keywords: [ai-agents, llm, agent-harness, code-verification, polyglot, mcp, agents-md, developer-tools]
